  title: Puzzle Levels
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>Puzzle Levels</b>


    Some upgrades and technologies require
    advanced computing capabilities before they can be unlocked.


    These capabilities
    are tested through Puzzle Levels.


    Puzzle Levels challenge your understanding
    of programming concepts such as movement, logic, sequencing, and problem solving.


    Completing
    puzzles may unlock new upgrades, systems, technologies, or progression paths
    required to continue repairing the ship.


    Different puzzles may introduce
    new mechanics and programming concepts as difficulty increases.'
